#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1337
msgid ""
"ℹ Server: ejabberd (mod_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd shares XMPP and MQTT authentication.\n"
"You can use your XMPP credentials to connect\n"
"to the MQTT broker on the same domain.\n"
"\n"
"Per-account mode uses these credentials automatically."
msgstr ""
"ℹ Server: ejabberd (mod_mqtt gedetecteerd)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd deelt XMPP- en MQTT-authenticatie.\n"
"Je kunt je XMPP-aanmeldgegevens gebruiken om te verbinden\n"
"met de MQTT-broker op hetzelfde domein.\n"
"\n"
"De modus per account gebruikt deze gegevens automatisch."

#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1345
msgid ""
"⚠ Server: Prosody (mod_pubsub_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"Prosody's MQTT bridge does NOT support authentication.\n"
"Any client on the network can subscribe to topics.\n"
"\n"
"Recommendations:\n"
"• Restrict MQTT port via firewall\n"
"• Use TLS for encryption\n"
"• Do not publish sensitive data\n"
"\n"
"Topic format: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"
msgstr ""
"⚠ Server: Prosody (mod_pubsub_mqtt gedetecteerd)\n"
"\n"
"De MQTT-brug van Prosody ondersteunt GEEN authenticatie.\n"
"Elke client op het netwerk kan zich op onderwerpen abonneren.\n"
"\n"
"Aanbevelingen:\n"
"• Beperk de MQTT-poort via de firewall\n"
"• Gebruik TLS voor versleuteling\n"
"• Publiceer geen gevoelige gegevens\n"
"\n"
"Onderwerpformaat: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"

